---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Eyebrow from "../components/Eyebrow.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The Movement | Turathi"
  description="Rebuilding the Islamic Renaissance: bringing meaning and craft back to how we build."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-24">
    <Eyebrow>The Movement</Eyebrow>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl text-navy sm:text-5xl">
      Rebuilding the Islamic Renaissance
    </h1>
    <span class="mt-5 block h-px w-16 bg-brass"></span>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-navy/70">
      In the rush to rebuild quickly and cheaply, we dropped ornament, craft and
      meaning. Glass towers and lifeless blocks replaced human buildings. This is
      my argument for bringing that meaning back, and for treating tradition as
      the better answer we stopped using, not as nostalgia.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
